# ML pipeline

- Entry point: `ml/dr_pathway/pipeline.py` → `analyze_fundus_image()`
- Upload decode: `ml/dr_pathway/image_io.py` (JPEG, PNG, TIFF, WebP, BMP)
- Optos UWF: `preprocess_fundus(..., camera_hint="optos_uwf")` before lesion detection
- Macular atrophy: `ml/dr_pathway/macular_atrophy.py` + grading in `grading.py`
- Default: classical CV (`USE_DL_MODELS=false` in docker-compose)

## Optos reference

- Stats: `data/processed/optos_reference/stats.json`
- Build: `data/pipelines/build_optos_reference.py` — use `diagnosis_folder` (AMD, Healthy, PM), not ICDR slug names

## Training

- `ml/training/train_icdr.py` stratifies by grade when `--max-samples` is set
- Fall back to synthetic bootstrap if fewer than 2 classes

## Tests

```bash
pytest ml/tests/test_image_io.py ml/tests/test_macular_atrophy.py ml/tests/test_vendor_neutral.py ml/tests/test_optos_pipelines.py
```
